B.a9d=s(["Some roles in nuclear or radiation facilities require a professional licence, qualification, or access permit depending on the role, facility, and regulator.","The employer may impose professional confidentiality requirements, security checks, or approvals to access sensitive areas or information.","These requirements do not automatically apply to every student or graduate merely for studying the specialty.","There is no reliable official source establishing a blanket travel ban for students or graduates of nuclear specialties.","If the employee works on a sensitive project or facility, some travel, disclosure, or access procedures may be tied to the employment contract, permits, and the employer's policy; refer to the relevant authority."],t.s)
